    "body": "Right... Although a *while* ago dfn.js did work during page load.\r\n\r\nThe only thing the script does now when it runs is to set a class and an event listener, so that's not very expensive (until you actually click). The value is that you don't need to wait for onload to start using the panel.\r\n\r\nNext to file-issue.js? Yeah, sure.",
